---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
const updated = "May 6, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="CaloricLab privacy policy. Learn how we handle (and don't collect) your personal health data."
  noindex={false}
>
  <!-- Page header — dark aurora band -->
  <header class="relative overflow-hidden py-10 sm:py-12" style="background-color: var(--cl-dark-nav);">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full" viewBox="0 0 1160 160" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
        <defs>
          <filter id="pb1"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="22"/></filter>
          <filter id="pb2"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="32"/></filter>
          <filter id="pb3"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="18"/></filter>
        </defs>
        <ellipse cx="200" cy="120" rx="420" ry="70" fill="none" style="stroke: var(--cl-teal-dark);" stroke-width="50" opacity="0.14" filter="url(#pb1)" transform="rotate(-6 200 120)"/>
        <ellipse cx="640" cy="80" rx="400" ry="55" fill="none" style="stroke: var(--cl-violet);" stroke-width="44" opacity="0.10" filter="url(#pb2)" transform="rotate(3 640 80)"/>
        <ellipse cx="980" cy="50" rx="280" ry="42" fill="none" style="stroke: var(--cl-teal);" stroke-width="30" opacity="0.09" filter="url(#pb3)" transform="rotate(-4 980 50)"/>
        <ellipse cx="480" cy="140" rx="320" ry="38" fill="none" style="stroke: var(--cl-teal-mid);" stroke-width="34" opacity="0.08" filter="url(#pb2)" transform="rotate(5 480 140)"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.40);">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14 space-y-8">

    <!-- TL;DR highlights -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-5" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--cl-violet);">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3" style="color: var(--cl-violet-dark);">Privacy at a glance</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        {[
          "Your health data (weight, height, age) never leaves your browser. We can't see it.",
          "We collect anonymous analytics only: page views and browser type.",
          "Advertising partners use cookies for ad targeting. You can opt out.",
        ].map(point => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-700">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" style="color: var(--cl-violet);" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12.416 3.376a.75.75 0 0 1 .208 1.04l-5 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.154.114l-3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l2.353 2.353 4.493-6.74a.75.75 0 0 1 1.04-.207z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
            </svg>
            {point}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      At CaloricLab ("we," "us," or "our"), your privacy is important to us. This policy explains
      what information we collect, how we use it, and how we protect it.
    </p>

    <!-- Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-3">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How We Handle Your Data</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
          All calculations on CaloricLab are performed <strong class="text-gray-800 font-semibold">entirely in your browser</strong>. 
          We do not require user accounts or email registration.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"/>
            <span><strong class="text-gray-800 font-semibold">Local Storage:</strong> Personal measurements (age, weight, height) are stored in your browser's local storage. This data stays on your device and is never sent to our servers.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"/>
            <span><strong class="text-gray-800 font-semibold">Data Retention:</strong> Because data is stored locally, it remains on your device until you clear your browser cache. We do not have access to this information.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-100"/>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Advertising and Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
          We use Google AdSense to serve advertisements. To do this, Google and third-party vendors use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"/>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-gray-800 font-semibold">Personalized Advertising:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"/>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-gray-800 font-semibold">Opting Out:</strong> You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting 
              <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--cl-violet-dark); font-weight: 500;" class="hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>. 
              Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting 
              <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--cl-violet-dark); font-weight: 500;" class="hover:underline">www.aboutads.info</a>.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <span class="mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"/>
            <span>
              <strong class="text-gray-800 font-semibold">Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand site traffic and usage patterns. GA4 uses cookies to collect anonymous data. No personally identifiable information (PII) is transmitted to Google via these tags.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-100"/>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Information Collected Automatically</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
          Like most websites, we collect standard analytics data including:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          {[
            "Pages visited and time spent",
            "Referring URLs",
            "Browser type and operating system",
            "Approximate geographic location (country/region level)",
          ].map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"/>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-100"/>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Medical Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          The calculations and information provided by CaloricLab are for <strong class="text-gray-800 font-semibold">educational and informational purposes only</strong>. They are not intended as medical advice or a substitute for professional consultation with a healthcare provider. 
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Individual nutritional and fitness needs vary significantly based on medical history and personal circumstances. Always seek the advice of a physician or other qualified health provider before beginning any new diet or fitness program.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-100"/>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Eligibility</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          CaloricLab is intended for use by individuals at least 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-100"/>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Questions about this policy? Email: {" "}
          <a href="mailto:hello.caloriclab@proton.me" style="color: var(--cl-violet-dark); font-weight: 500;" class="hover:underline">hello.caloriclab@proton.me</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>